  "segments": {
    "00-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "db799189265aa67afc13b83263f8581aa5bcc04f6e160b8a2c88602a4688db5c",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:49:35.714272+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/00-00.mp3",
      "duration": 25.848,
      "providerDurationMs": 25848,
      "bytes": 415284,
      "sha256": "4b245502596c2b00dcd9e4664f4f4657153d64c844afde47cdb37b9097f48656",
      "usageCharacters": 200,
      "inputCharacters": 106,
      "traceId": "070e5cc926a507053ab2553c26e2c143",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 15.167,
          "text": "先看这幅最终画面。中间的暗区、周围的亮盘、上下的弧，分别来自不同原因。黑洞是一个连光也不能逃向遥远外部的时空区域，边界叫事件视界。"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.367,
          "end": 21.06,
          "text": "沿某些方向回溯光路，光会被捕获，因此那里显暗。"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.204,
          "end": 25.678,
          "text": "不过，画面暗区并不就是事件视界本身。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "25.848000",
          "size": "415284"
        }
      }
    },
    "00-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "93115cd5d85bab0400654520b5a8a496cf2f804455456bf50de99d652ba10a2b",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:08.338482+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/00-01.mp3",
      "duration": 24.012,
      "providerDurationMs": 24012,
      "bytes": 385908,
      "sha256": "8f72825ba39b1f7c1255f163fc9e2cb629bdd8075a6dfefd75c5182ff4cd9a19",
      "usageCharacters": 204,
      "inputCharacters": 107,
      "traceId": "070e5ceaee915697758fa16be3b7ea11",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 17.315,
          "text": "再看横着穿过暗区的亮带。它主要是黑洞外面的热气体，叫吸积盘。黑洞本身没有一个像恒星那样燃烧的表面。我们能看见亮盘，是因为附近有气体供给，而且气体释放了能量。"
        },
        {
          "start": 17.46,
          "end": 23.86,
          "text": "周围没有明亮物质，黑洞仍然可以存在，只是不会有这样的亮圈。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "24.012000",
          "size": "385908"
        }
      }
    },
    "00-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "0387a108bb92556129a2a08be9e6c8d8edaf4011ed3ab501f4c1278b4ca20f42",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:08.015836+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/00-02.mp3",
      "duration": 27.288,
      "providerDurationMs": 27288,
      "bytes": 438324,
      "sha256": "387e6ecfc6e432c018822c581e3d1eb54af4543c266a3f033e489f0425052cbf",
      "usageCharacters": 224,
      "inputCharacters": 117,
      "traceId": "070e5cea5487d8640b8f2229b170afb5",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.041,
          "text": "最后看暗区上方和下方的弧。盘没有真的翘成一个拱门。那是盘背面的光在弯曲时空里传播，最后进入观察者的眼睛，形成了变形的影像。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.241,
          "end": 20.041,
          "text": "接下来，我们先回到一颗恒星，再一步步连接到这些效果。"
        },
        {
          "start": 20.196,
          "end": 27.143,
          "text": "后面的箭头图是机制示意，标着计算结果的图则使用指定物理模型。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "27.288000",
          "size": "438324"
        }
      }
    },
    "01-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "147f23a1890648ae9291781eafccb5a44b44df5aeabb5a7757b41ca2cc503ffd",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:09.418570+00:00",
