    "01-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "3e229c11e5a5d9e97b02b594778658e95bc419db6a23788683e0650143c08a20",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:15.359637+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/01-01.mp3",
      "duration": 24.372,
      "providerDurationMs": 24372,
      "bytes": 391668,
      "sha256": "6288a02d9873f642690e9df8bd35e2669eb2f99cee3870e4dd65e48be6f27e6a",
      "usageCharacters": 192,
      "inputCharacters": 101,
      "traceId": "070e5cf19ff226fa349049beba800fd8",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 15.9,
          "text": "橙色箭头表示向外的压力支撑。恒星内部越靠中心，压力通常越高；这种压力的空间差异，抵抗向内的引力。核心的核聚变释放能量，帮助维持高温。"
        },
        {
          "start": 16.056,
          "end": 24.211,
          "text": "因此，真正直接支撑恒星的是压力梯度，核聚变则是维持这种状态的重要能源。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "24.372000",
          "size": "391668"
        }
      }
    },
    "01-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "347c80d0cf74e0e9d2269dc85b0cd4eb5abab6c8918f5b8119de79ec4fb81cb3",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:15.755426+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/01-02.mp3",
      "duration": 27.9,
      "providerDurationMs": 27900,
      "bytes": 448116,
      "sha256": "b5532cbcab23f533b506ce8e70264d3ee3cdb73b5b7dbd2dff298a0fa5dbbee2",
      "usageCharacters": 218,
      "inputCharacters": 114,
      "traceId": "070e5cf1355a8e1fb92f4580c7ade49a",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.981,
          "text": "看两组箭头彼此平衡，恒星就能维持近似稳定的结构。黑洞形成的关键，是后面失去足够支撑，并继续压缩。但不是所有恒星都走这条路线。"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.181,
          "end": 21.142,
          "text": "像太阳这样的恒星，正常演化的最终残留是白矮星。"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.312,
          "end": 27.76,
          "text": "这里选择的是大质量恒星的核心塌缩，不能代表所有黑洞的起源。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "27.900000",
          "size": "448116"
        }
      }
    },
    "02-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "9b342eb731eae25236f9ed68f211383c0f9e4d7e5c827ebcdd7b4267a783245e",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:19.136737+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/02-00.mp3",
      "duration": 26.676,
      "providerDurationMs": 26676,
      "bytes": 428532,
      "sha256": "e1e32f81e326da3c54f99679cb39e8b11f62cb48ad7cb0c9243be97d7943abb2",
      "usageCharacters": 198,
      "inputCharacters": 104,
      "traceId": "070e5cf5a40ec3f20f59de22e74b9bad",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 13.8,
          "text": "现在看橙色箭头逐渐变短。大质量恒星经过多阶段燃烧，晚期可能形成铁族核心。铁族物质继续聚变，不能再提供净能量。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.0,
          "end": 22.387,
          "text": "电子被原子核俘获，会改变压力支撑；高能光子拆解原子核，还会消耗能量。"
        },
        {
          "start": 22.536,
          "end": 26.523,
          "text": "这些过程一起促使核心失去稳定性。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "26.676000",
          "size": "428532"
        }
      }
    },
    "02-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "70259e00d833107a3522d28bb7e9f2c87c2060a07063f8ff628df7b0a0400a76",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:22.716498+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/02-01.mp3",
      "duration": 24.48,
      "providerDurationMs": 24480,
      "bytes": 393396,
      "sha256": "c5a6694c0187092f0c66d10c4d8a6645fd0ebbcb87d0f3b587b949be8d97abbf",
      "usageCharacters": 193,
      "inputCharacters": 102,
      "traceId": "070e5cf8283141a5ef13b79ee9c0333d",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 13.9,
          "text": "支撑不足以后，引力占了上风，核心快速向中心收缩，密度随之上升。注意，这不是突然长出了一种新吸力，也不是坍塌向外蔓延。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.04,
          "end": 24.34,
          "text": "外层仍有自己的演化，可能在超新星中被抛出，也可能继续落入，或者在爆炸后回落到残留天体上。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "24.480000",
          "size": "393396"
        }
      }
    },
    "02-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "0e24e9fce36379ef1a85331e24f9541d5f44c53816b9227f293b8ef80c05d416",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:23.129608+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/02-02.mp3",
      "duration": 28.728,
      "providerDurationMs": 28728,
      "bytes": 461364,
      "sha256": "0aea62e7bad7951442fe7e7a15b99f529bce22d14cb3a7620450d94e8935f004",
      "usageCharacters": 224,
      "inputCharacters": 117,
      "traceId": "070e5cf9583d1d38b4201f2fc1aee7ae",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 10.2,
          "text": "核心收缩并不保证一定形成黑洞。中子星也能由这条路线产生，它依靠致密物质的压力继续支撑。"
        },
        {
          "start": 10.4,
          "end": 20.261,
          "text": "如果残留核心太重，或者后来又吸收了足够的物质，支撑仍然不足，就可能进一步形成黑洞。"
        },
        {
          "start": 20.412,
          "end": 28.567,
          "text": "有些成洞过程没有明亮的超新星。超大质量黑洞的起源，则需要另行讨论。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "28.728000",
          "size": "461364"
        }
      }
    },
    "03-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "a578e8f6f7bbf8fdbe8d83b976132177af2237dfe514fc6ea69c2d6f5118832c",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:26.037910+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/03-00.mp3",
      "duration": 25.704,
      "providerDurationMs": 25704,
      "bytes": 412980,
      "sha256": "04b8c8f41b9175a88e856521c500edd6c6325e5f221a9fc4c8ec9282b9190af6",
      "usageCharacters": 209,
      "inputCharacters": 110,
      "traceId": "070e5cfc8c528215f34bd0e87b4d395b",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 13.7,
          "text": "把最后一段收缩放大。对这个无旋转、球对称的例子，质量决定一个关键尺度，叫史瓦西半径。默认十个太阳质量，对应大约三十公里。"
        },
        {
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 25.56,
          "text": "图中物质边界从这个半径的四倍开始下落，所以已经非常紧凑，不是一颗普通恒星的原始大小。动画也被放慢了。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "25.704000",
          "size": "412980"
        }
      }
    },
    "03-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "a95f1ff53cc9993a42fc27391048876146294f6171c87dcc228ecff038205d1f",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:31.226134+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/03-01.mp3",
      "duration": 26.208,
      "providerDurationMs": 26208,
      "bytes": 421044,
      "sha256": "9b32c49511f84e1921af72b7362fdc325815a9c9293ac8c99a4793300f010594",
      "usageCharacters": 207,
      "inputCharacters": 109,
      "traceId": "070e5d010aefc2548863082bc0b80198",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 15.2,
          "text": "左边记录下落物质自身经历的时间，右边记录同一次发光事件的信号，在远处何时被收到。边界越接近虚线，信号越红、越弱，到达延迟也越大。"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.4,
          "end": 18.307,
          "text": "因此远处逐渐难以看见它。"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.468,
          "end": 26.042,
          "text": "这不表示物质真正停住，也不是永远能看到一个明亮、冻结在边界上的球。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "26.208000",
          "size": "421044"
        }
      }
    },
    "03-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "743305d0b46e110f5f65cecfbd29cc6c166320c1ad5fb1001a871bae804c426b",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:29.979994+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/03-02.mp3",
      "duration": 26.1,
      "providerDurationMs": 26100,
      "bytes": 419316,
      "sha256": "0f09a4d5e2d01d4637e99c36fd4b18edefab047e913760a018ec0d6f6a933401",
      "usageCharacters": 220,
      "inputCharacters": 114,
      "traceId": "070e5d0049011077f17c07958393c451",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 10.767,
          "text": "按物质自己的时钟，它可以在有限时间跨过这个参考半径。跨入以后发出的信号，就无法抵达遥远外部。"
        },
        {
          "start": 10.908,
          "end": 25.936,
          "text": "这一段用固定外部时空中的自由落体计算，解释最后的下落与信号变化；它没有求解整颗恒星的内部，也没有计算事件视界在真实塌缩全过程中怎样诞生。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "26.100000",
          "size": "419316"
        }
      }
    },
    "04-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "90a93d1e5ba2d73d51c27d5d7e4585d7df7edacaf9fe4ab52b97b6e9723fe1d3",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:33.111739+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/04-00.mp3",
      "duration": 24.588,
      "providerDurationMs": 24588,
      "bytes": 395124,
      "sha256": "14dd184e37c3152083b85a5a4fbad7de50d813b090eb0df873e27b51b960b34a",
      "usageCharacters": 197,
      "inputCharacters": 104,
      "traceId": "070e5d03a66a84da7cebb15b6b66c8d6",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 17.28,
          "text": "现在直接问：连光也逃不出，究竟是什么意思？图中横轴是半径，纵轴是一种能够跨过视界的时间坐标。我们在视界外、视界上、视界内，分别考虑朝外发射的光。"
        },
        {
          "start": 17.424,
          "end": 24.418,
          "text": "彩色曲线是按这个模型的径向光路方程算出来的，不是随意弯曲的箭头。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "24.588000",
          "size": "395124"
        }
      }
    },
    "04-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "7f5437d6af71aff155e71501ec3dcb8d02bf0cf2a8980b4b80624a6561de7ea4",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:38.845917+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/04-01.mp3",
      "duration": 22.248,
      "providerDurationMs": 22248,
      "bytes": 357684,
      "sha256": "6121538a3b69cebc888aaa0b60cebefb4bbfa2cfc5d3c1c8c2a6a6da57739698",
      "usageCharacters": 186,
      "inputCharacters": 98,
      "traceId": "070e5d0816ac4c71b916ba3bd0f9efed",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 13.46,
          "text": "看视界外的曲线，它能走向更大的半径。恰在视界上的出射光，沿边界延续。而视界内部，连朝外的这条未来光路，也走向更小的半径。"
        },
        {
          "start": 13.608,
          "end": 22.108,
          "text": "光没有撞上一层黑色外壳，而是内部的因果结构，已经不允许它的未来抵达遥远外部。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "22.248000",
