    "04-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "6a12aaede96dd082fc270eee8f96d1560a148a6034678901f9390047511d2687",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:38.795779+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/04-02.mp3",
      "duration": 25.668,
      "providerDurationMs": 25668,
      "bytes": 412404,
      "sha256": "abd99cc960333802fd250dc42142d1fd22341fd14db59b9a6e5d032188d3d6c0",
      "usageCharacters": 213,
      "inputCharacters": 112,
      "traceId": "070e5d08cd126ed0c1c8ccc7fdb4418d",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.668,
          "text": "光在当地被测量时，仍然以光速传播，并没有越跑越慢。这张坐标图的斜率，不是局部光速。黑洞的定义因此是一种因果边界，不是一块黑色固体。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.832,
          "end": 25.506,
          "text": "这个图描述已形成、无旋转黑洞的模型；中心的极端区域与量子引力，也没有被当成可观察的实体画出来。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "25.668000",
          "size": "412404"
        }
      }
    },
    "05-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "37afc50e70f354b3838d551f077c1b981e724a7f8c0565d4ee7ee29e69b5148f",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:41.382415+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/05-00.mp3",
      "duration": 26.388,
      "providerDurationMs": 26388,
      "bytes": 423924,
      "sha256": "c62ba27704228d2e8b28d7dc19bda84e2b5d460a527c27b27392fa2c7db3cd6d",
      "usageCharacters": 207,
      "inputCharacters": 109,
      "traceId": "070e5d0a74c2585d75272a35af7551ae",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 9.5,
          "text": "形成黑洞之后，再加入周围的气体。这些物质可能来自伴星、恒星残骸，或者附近环境。"
        },
        {
          "start": 9.7,
          "end": 18.6,
          "text": "先把它们和黑洞分开：黑洞决定强引力与光的因果边界，气体才提供我们看到的亮光。"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.756,
          "end": 26.237,
          "text": "没有这些外部物质，黑洞也成立，只是这段漂亮的吸积盘景象不会出现。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "26.388000",
          "size": "423924"
        }
      }
    },
    "05-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "c727d736e42c2d79066d87f89c6f5865bc26b4c008d6f3c2f7f92f7b8c51d1af",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:46.603995+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/05-01.mp3",
      "duration": 24.696,
      "providerDurationMs": 24696,
      "bytes": 396852,
      "sha256": "01aff3c02315ce1cf3aa57c1450ae7410a19a92faae447a1cfef2f56f63a430d",
      "usageCharacters": 197,
      "inputCharacters": 103,
      "traceId": "070e5d10f0722b3ef610b5751894643f",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 10.895,
          "text": "观察粒子的轨迹。气体通常带着角动量，可以理解为有绕中心运动的趋势，因此不会全都沿直线掉下去。"
        },
        {
          "start": 11.095,
          "end": 18.495,
          "text": "不同气流的碰撞、能量耗散和冷却，有助于物质集中到共同旋转的平面。"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.648,
          "end": 24.548,
          "text": "这里选择薄盘来解释机制，现实中的吸积流也可能很厚。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "24.696000",
          "size": "396852"
        }
      }
    },
    "05-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "48474686af59b9f2193f705cae4a77ed20463476a4dfb60aceebe8041e9df2c5",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:46.635974+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/05-02.mp3",
      "duration": 26.172,
      "providerDurationMs": 26172,
      "bytes": 420468,
      "sha256": "74410b4ee844e33190071fec561f296341f79880d8fa610b86b1e7d43ade73aa",
      "usageCharacters": 204,
      "inputCharacters": 107,
      "traceId": "070e5d10d3116380125ac37ff12171e8",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 11.754,
          "text": "成盘并不是故事的终点。气体还要把角动量向外输运，一部分物质才可以继续向内。磁应力与湍流是重要机制。"
        },
        {
          "start": 11.954,
          "end": 18.754,
          "text": "按住对照，会看到理想的零角动量下落，两者差别就在绕行。"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.9,
          "end": 26.021,
          "text": "这是解释机制的动画，没有真的计算气体流动、磁场或湍流怎样演化。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "26.172000",
          "size": "420468"
        }
      }
    },
    "06-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "1f9c0e021bc74dba50b00799aa3ba6ebe62577fac48e71c523b7a9386589bf13",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:48.530687+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/06-00.mp3",
      "duration": 25.632,
      "providerDurationMs": 25632,
      "bytes": 411828,
      "sha256": "3f2493e8fa4c4ba7fa4857cf9e40af6221b03feb55b38baa261a03ca1463eaa5",
      "usageCharacters": 208,
      "inputCharacters": 109,
      "traceId": "070e5d120b919240b10a8504dcd69546",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.8,
          "text": "物质向内吸积，轨道能量发生变化，其中一部分经应力和耗散转成热，热气体再向外辐射。亮光因此来自视界外，绝不是从黑洞内部漏出来。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.94,
          "end": 25.475,
          "text": "接下来看到的温度曲线，是由质量、物质供给率和半径算出的稳态薄盘近似，不是模拟每团气体实时加热。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "25.632000",
          "size": "411828"
        }
      }
    },
    "06-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "9d9dee4f7978293f385f94452f8fc60b07161f0f692355151fefc18f6da9b215",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:53.391202+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/06-01.mp3",
      "duration": 27.324,
      "providerDurationMs": 27324,
      "bytes": 438900,
      "sha256": "5bc33dacda696eb95c1150e61b13e48df166fef7dcd864a26c21672506f807ea",
      "usageCharacters": 223,
      "inputCharacters": 117,
      "traceId": "070e5d17b5da36c987af1f89c6724593",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 16.9,
          "text": "看曲线如何随着物质供给增加而升高。供给越多，这个模型释放的能量越多，温度也就越高。但是温度并非一直向中心攀升：在采用零力矩条件的理想内边缘，它会回落。"
        },
        {
          "start": 17.064,
          "end": 27.158,
          "text": "无旋转模型的最内稳定圆轨道，位于史瓦西半径的三倍；越过这里，气体难以维持稳定圆轨道。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "27.324000",
          "size": "438900"
        }
      }
    },
    "06-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "7ccf02079db908b6f8833f342e3553021bcc54e5b6c56d777a3a4cd91c97fb16",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:53.513234+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/06-02.mp3",
