      "providerDurationMs": 27000,
      "bytes": 433716,
      "sha256": "71e86a9cdac0afb33bce491c23555922dc4ae6326e369e33f81b495532f78646",
      "usageCharacters": 212,
      "inputCharacters": 113,
      "traceId": "070e5d184736bf9161be7e5c3af059de",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 15.794,
          "text": "默认例子的最高局部温度接近二百万开尔文，黑体的波长峰值在软 X 射线附近。主画面只显示可见光波段，并调节曝光，所以高温气体偏白、偏蓝。"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.948,
          "end": 26.848,
          "text": "切换后的橙色，是明确标注的假色温度图，不是火焰的实际颜色。改变参数后，请以页面实时读数为准。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "27.000000",
          "size": "433716"
        }
      }
    },
    "07-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "47d50f38309b68167b55a9f4118ffd81491be43fb1458ded21af18b302b4bbce",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:50:55.060926+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/07-00.mp3",
      "duration": 24.12,
      "providerDurationMs": 24120,
      "bytes": 387636,
      "sha256": "b8f05764a61e23f136fc637c8fa08c0bd20cbff5f69dfcf3e5bc5672b681551b",
      "usageCharacters": 203,
      "inputCharacters": 105,
      "traceId": "070e5d19e4e9067663611e42cf8ad165",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 13.2,
          "text": "现在切换到眼睛所见的图像。主画面是观察者收到光以后形成的影像，右上小图则显示光在空间中的路径，两者不是同一个视角。"
        },
        {
          "start": 13.356,
          "end": 23.984,
          "text": "小图的两条曲线来自背面盘上不同的发光位置，最后到达同一个观察者，不能理解成同一个点发出的两束光。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "24.120000",
          "size": "387636"
        }
      }
    },
    "07-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "862ddfaa473656e72bac17151397a4c64ad5e04c605794d2131a1067552c7157",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:51:01.009651+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/07-01.mp3",
      "duration": 26.568,
      "providerDurationMs": 26568,
      "bytes": 426804,
      "sha256": "86e523b3b23ea7239bb7d1be13d65a136b397261d0dac8d01823b5cdd93565cc",
      "usageCharacters": 211,
      "inputCharacters": 111,
      "traceId": "070e5d1f277873d3a176dbb11f24c808",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.354,
          "text": "跟着小光点，看背面盘的光如何来到眼睛。广义相对论中，光沿时空允许的光路传播；在黑洞附近，这条路相对于远处的方向发生明显弯折。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.554,
          "end": 20.596,
          "text": "因此，本来位于背面的盘面，也能出现在暗区上方和下方。"
        },
        {
          "start": 20.736,
          "end": 26.429,
          "text": "这就是引力透镜形成的亮弧，而不是盘真的被掰弯。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "26.568000",
          "size": "426804"
        }
      }
    },
    "07-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "238d8d0bfd9763664425280fa1045163350cb6d74caf6ab39b402064e49bac4f",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:51:05.153111+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/07-02.mp3",
      "duration": 27.648,
      "providerDurationMs": 27648,
      "bytes": 444084,
      "sha256": "c0d9cee507e3116087e123a5016621a8c43067289c98cae4ecf666b54cb5a9d4",
      "usageCharacters": 214,
      "inputCharacters": 112,
      "traceId": "070e5d23e4ba02c41ba3137a0b371786",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 15.655,
          "text": "按住直线光路对照，上下亮弧明显改变或消失，横向的盘仍然存在。这个差别把因果关系展示出来：气体负责发光，弯曲光路负责改变影像位置。"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.855,
          "end": 18.655,
          "text": "真实宇宙不能关掉引力。"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.792,
          "end": 27.492,
          "text": "实时计算还有有限步长和预算，所以特别细的高阶光子环，不能保证全部解析出来。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "27.648000",
          "size": "444084"
        }
      }
    },
    "08-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "47fb9999dca7e828c1e9c45693e2c2e8f90abe0e976977d0ae72f23aa26f2106",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:51:03.589400+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/08-00.mp3",
      "duration": 23.724,
      "providerDurationMs": 23724,
      "bytes": 381300,
      "sha256": "392b566dfb512d6eeabbf52d51565314b283e0d127e61031dfb8b95e7563cc83",
      "usageCharacters": 203,
      "inputCharacters": 107,
      "traceId": "070e5d221622b0c4d4e57eca505673d6",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.134,
          "text": "再看吸积盘的两侧。一侧通常较亮，另一侧较暗。这不是两边温度一定不同，而是气体在高速绕行，相对于进入眼睛的光线，它们的运动方向不同。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.292,
          "end": 23.573,
          "text": "和声波的多普勒效应有一点相似，运动会改变收到的频率；对于光，它还会改变收到的辐亮度。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "23.724000",
          "size": "381300"
        }
      }
    },
    "08-01": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "8a8dc0d6bbd72d8ef36f09c61a4817e950103634fc1609561f6fea00defbfb16",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:51:08.016847+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/08-01.mp3",
      "duration": 27.684,
      "providerDurationMs": 27684,
      "bytes": 444660,
      "sha256": "6b8a65dc9fb6427bee802acb3b9f161cf5db58a2353db6a1481345e3dfbe6274",
      "usageCharacters": 217,
      "inputCharacters": 115,
      "traceId": "070e5d26339b1ac7ded6b15167d6f4c7",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.4,
          "text": "朝向接收光方向运动的气体，通常显得更亮、更偏蓝；远离的一侧通常更暗、更偏红。同时，光离开强引力区域，还会受到引力红移。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.6,
          "end": 20.874,
          "text": "这里把运动与引力带来的频率变化合在一起，再计算接收光谱。"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.024,
          "end": 27.524,
          "text": "因此，显示的颜色和亮度，不能只靠一个任意增亮开关来决定。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "27.684000",
          "size": "444660"
        }
      }
    },
    "08-02": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "582036ab84be8fae8c6817443c983c2360cfd0c40c7880f0faf2b27f6b708af5",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:51:11.577090+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/08-02.mp3",
      "duration": 26.208,
      "providerDurationMs": 26208,
      "bytes": 421044,
      "sha256": "609ee4f4e5cd28695edcf1b45155760d776fa96b8a69b55af35c860e054fc275",
      "usageCharacters": 207,
      "inputCharacters": 108,
      "traceId": "070e5d2a042c7a54a9d0dadccb08223a",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 11.614,
          "text": "按住关闭运动频移，透镜造成的形状保留，两侧由运动产生的明暗差减弱。局部温度和纹理仍会造成变化。"
        },
        {
          "start": 11.772,
          "end": 26.072,
          "text": "可见光亮度取决于选中的波段；对所有频率积分后的总辐亮度，还有另一种变换关系，假色模式用它表现趋势。这两种亮度不能混为一谈。"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "programs": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "sample_rate": "32000",
            "channels": 1
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "26.208000",
          "size": "421044"
        }
      }
    },
    "09-00": {
      "status": "succeeded",
      "fingerprint": "0836b25b1defb7f327e68a6c850b34fc0a8373749c9d2c2ebcb048b0182b9e62",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T03:51:12.300409+00:00",
      "src": "audio/narration/09-00.mp3",
      "duration": 28.512,
      "providerDurationMs": 28512,
      "bytes": 457908,
      "sha256": "e146a635903b94a51a00ad8627fff4c495def5d6e8717b7a5102a9bc0614d775",
      "usageCharacters": 229,
      "inputCharacters": 120,
      "traceId": "070e5d2a4f1eccc77ee9dd4220e41c69",
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 14.714,
          "text": "把原因连起来：大质量恒星的核心失去足够支撑，继续压缩，在合适条件下留下黑洞。附近有带角动量的气体，气体可能成盘并释放能量。"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.868,
          "end": 28.368,
          "text": "辐射在弯曲时空中传播，又受到运动与引力的频率变化，最终形成现在这幅影像。后半段的效果在现实中同时存在，不是依次开启的。"
        }
      ],
